{
  "_doc": "Cards play in order of this list (round robin) between photo runs. Fields: id, type (cards/<type>.{py,js}), enabled, shows ([show ids], omit = all), when {days: 'mon-fri' | [..], hours: ['HH:MM-HH:MM', ..]}, duration (s), interrupt (cut in when it has data), repeat_minutes (interrupt: don't repeat the same item sooner), overlay ('corner' = clock+temp on top), every_minutes (show at most once per N minutes), layer ('over' = play on top of the current slide), options (passed to the card's fetch). These are the shipped defaults: the admin page (/admin) stores views, card overrides and keys in DATA_DIR (server.py docstring); 'shows' + each card's 'shows' only seed the views on first boot.",
